formed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385515217","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111447#issuecomment-3385515217","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111447","id":3385515217,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JytzR","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T11:51:53Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T11:51:53Z","body":"This behavior was introduced in 4.4 (#88511).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385515217/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385549870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111447#issuecomment-3385549870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111447","id":3385549870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Jy2Qu","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T12:01:42Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T12:01:42Z","body":"Yes, I was going to say that this behaviour was recent. \n\nOne thing is that a lot of people are using Blender to make their levels, so you might not get a lot of feedback from a level editting perspective? \n\nWhen we design assets that goes on the floor, we want to control the floor level by placing the origin where we want. For instance, if you spawn a tree, you don't want Godot to offset the tree so that the roots are above the ground level.\n\nAnother example from 80lv, where we want assets to be partly underground:\nhttps://80.lv/articles/trick-for-reducing-vertex-count-for-custom-unity-grass-renderer","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385549870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385658051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111447#issuecomment-3385658051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111447","id":3385658051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JzQrD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T12:33:05Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T17:57:27Z","body":"I'd say adding a new modifier behavior where holding down some modifier makes it shoot for the origin instead (i.e. the old behavior), as by the time 4.6 is released (based on past release pacing it won't be earlier than early next year) this will have been part of the editor behavior for two full versions and likely over a year (in release, over a year and a half in pre-releases)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385658051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386916837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111447#issuecomment-3386916837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111447","id":3386916837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J4D_l","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T17:45:29Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T17:45:29Z","body":"Not sure about the modifier key, as they are already used for \"adding as sibling/adding as child\" I think. I would rather use modifier keys when really necessary/beneficial.\n \nHere to snap on the bounding box or snap on the origin is something you won't often change. Maybe doing your entire project with origin snap, or parts of the level with collision snap.\n\nMaybe:\n- a dropbox in the snap tool settings\n- or a toggle button in the toolbar\n\nI think it would make sense to have settings for the snap tool (can't remember if it exists already).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386916837/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]